# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
# Phase 1 demo posture: enable conservative defense-in-depth headers without a
# strict CSP (a misconfigured CSP would silently break WebAuthn / Google Fonts
# / Soroban RPC for end-users on the public host). Phase 2 should add CSP once
# the third-party origin set is frozen.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
